{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-server-panel-worker-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"11","surface":"server","area":"server/panel-worker","refs":["F-server-103","F-server-102"],"severity":"S4","title":"Gym messages pop up at once only while the admin app uses our own server address","what":"After the owner sends a message, starts an offer or answers a member question, our server tells HQ to send the phone pop-ups straight away. That nudge is only given for requests that pass through our own server address. When that address fails and the admin app falls back to the gym server's direct address, no nudge is given and members get the pop-up at HQ's next one-minute round. A failed nudge only writes a warning line in the log.","expected":"The pop-up goes out at once whichever address the admin app used, or the feature is described as 'within a minute'.","evidence":["deploy/panel/proxy.js:8-9","deploy/panel/proxy.js:75-95","deploy/panel/worker.js:109-110","deploy/hq/push.js:6-8"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"push-nudge-only-through-proxy","who":"members","how_often":"only when our server address is down or blocked","fix_line":"Also nudge HQ from the gym server side, or call the feature 'within a minute'.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
